    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9ba9b07730127982f7c4bc2d030b594d.avif?t=1755004444\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW \u2728</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/26aee42423b9e0de06f39ebd5afcf9bb.avif?t=1755004444\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/e0c52a61db31e3429af416797b0f9d1d.avif?t=1755004444\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is The Enigma Case?\u00a0\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enigma Cases will test your detective abilities, drawing you into complex and detailed cases. Examine crime scenes, gather and analyze clues, interrogate suspects, and take all necessary steps to solve the cases. Each case offers a different challenge and mystery to solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/4a6bb049c47721fe43c7eb30a8486a19.poster.avif?t=1755004444\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/4a6bb049c47721fe43c7eb30a8486a19.webm?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/4a6bb049c47721fe43c7eb30a8486a19.mp4?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied Cases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murders, Accidents, and Suicides: Each case has a unique story and mysteries waiting to be solved. Use all your detective skills to solve murders, accidents, and suicides. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Crime Scenes: Examine crime scenes in detail. From cafes to highways, every location is carefully designed and filled with clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/cce08874cc9cf19c0859f27441cc8241.poster.avif?t=1755004444\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/cce08874cc9cf19c0859f27441cc8241.webm?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/cce08874cc9cf19c0859f27441cc8241.mp4?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detective Roles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Field Detective: Collects physical evidence at the crime scene, analyzes the clues, and interrogates suspects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Detective: Investigates digital evidence, examines social media accounts, and analyzes emails and GPS records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/2dbea5540108acc9e58228bf6a264232.poster.avif?t=1755004444\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/2dbea5540108acc9e58228bf6a264232.webm?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/2dbea5540108acc9e58228bf6a264232.mp4?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Cooperation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Friends: Work together with your friends to solve cases. Each player can take on a different role, collaborating to uncover the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Community: Join forces with other detectives, share clues, and solve the toughest cases together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d62d08644ba5b7b971175597fcc569ba.poster.avif?t=1755004444\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d62d08644ba5b7b971175597fcc569ba.webm?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d62d08644ba5b7b971175597fcc569ba.mp4?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-Depth Investigations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security Cameras and Digital Evidence: Examine security camera footage at the crime scene, gather and analyze digital evidence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxicological and Forensic Examinations: Determine the cause of death in poisoning cases by using autopsy reports and toxicological analyses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic and Engaging Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Scenarios: Each case offers a detailed and realistic story that will draw you in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprising Outcomes: Be prepared for surprises and unexpected outcomes at the end of each case.<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to Your Wishlist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add our game to your wishlist and join our Discord to support us in development!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1755004444\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1755004444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
